<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { margin-top: 0; }
  .header-logo { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .header-logo img { max-width: 200px; height: auto; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-group { flex: 1; }
  .line-item-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  .line-item-table td { padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; }
  .signature-line { margin-top: 50px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
    <div style="font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold;">UNK</div>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      UNIVERSITY<br>
      OF NEBRASKA<br>
      KEARNEY
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center;">REPLACEMENT DIPLOMA REQUEST FORM</h2>

  <p>UNK Replacement Diplomas (available to all graduates) are available for <span data-field="cost_replacement_diploma_1">{{ cost_replacement_diploma_1 }}</span>, and an additional <span data-field="cost_replacement_diploma_2">{{ cost_replacement_diploma_2 }}</span> for a diploma cover (optional). Please allow <span data-field="processing_time_weeks">{{ processing_time_weeks }}</span> weeks for processing.</p>

  <p>Kearney State College Diplomas (only available for graduates prior to 1991) are available for <span data-field="cost_kearney_diploma_1">{{ cost_kearney_diploma_1 }}</span>, and an additional <span data-field="cost_kearney_diploma_2">{{ cost_kearney_diploma_2 }}</span> for a diploma cover (optional). The timeline for processing is approximately <span data-field="processing_time_kearney">{{ processing_time_kearney }}</span> weeks after ordering.</p>

  <div class="section-title">REQUIRED INFORMATION:</div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Name* (as you'd like it to appear on your diploma):</label>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">First: <span data-field="full_name_first">{{ full_name_first }}</span></div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">Middle: <span data-field="full_name_middle">{{ full_name_middle }}</span></div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">Last: <span data-field="full_name_last">{{ full_name_last }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      Student ID: _________________________
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      Graduation Date: _________________________
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      Date of Birth: _________________________
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      Current Phone Number: ( <span data-field="phone_area_code">{{ phone_area_code }}</span> ) <span data-field="phone_prefix">{{ phone_prefix }}</span> - <span data-field="phone_line">{{ phone_line }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Current Address:
      <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
        Street: <span data-field="address_street">{{ address_street }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 5px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">City: <span data-field="address_city">{{ address_city }}</span></div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">State: <span data-field="address_state">{{ address_state }}</span></div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">Zip: <span data-field="address_zip">{{ address_zip }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-line">
    Signature: _________________________
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Items Ordered:</div>

  <table class="line-item-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="text-align: left;">Description</th>
        <th style="text-align: right;">Amount</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="line_items[0].description">{{ line_items[0].description }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="line_items[0].amount">{{ line_items[0].amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="line_items[1].description">{{ line_items[1].description }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="line_items[1].amount">{{ line_items[1].amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="line_items[2].description">{{ line_items[2].description }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="line_items[2].amount">{{ line_items[2].amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="line_items[3].description">{{ line_items[3].description }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="line_items[3].amount">{{ line_items[3].amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Total Fee Enclosed: $<span data-field="total_fee">{{ total_fee }}</span></p>

  <p style="font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 30px;">*Fee should be made out to University of Nebraska – Kearney (UNK).</p>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Please mail the above information and fee to the following address:</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 0.9em;">
    University of Nebraska – Kearney<br>
    <span data-field="mailing_street_1">{{ mailing_street_1 }}</span><br>
    <span data-field="mailing_street_2">{{ mailing_street_2 }}</span><br>
    <span data-field="mailing_city">{{ mailing_city }}</span>, <span data-field="mailing_state">{{ mailing_state }}</span> <span data-field="mailing_zip">{{ mailing_zip }}</span>
  </div>
</div>